ald','Gen III (Hoenn)','Sealeo live in herds on ice floes. Using its powerful flippers, it shatters ice. It dives into the sea to hunt prey five times a day.'),(9673,364,'firered','Gen III (Kanto)','It touches new things with its nose to test for smell and feel. It plays by spinning SPHEAL on its nose.'),(9674,364,'leafgreen','Gen III (Kanto)','It touches new things with its nose to test for smell and feel. It plays by spinning SPHEAL on its nose.'),(9675,364,'diamond','Gen IV (Sinnoh)','It habitually spins things on its nose. By doing so, it learns textures and odors.'),(9676,364,'pearl','Gen IV (Sinnoh)','It habitually spins things on its nose. By doing so, it learns textures and odors.'),(9677,364,'platinum','Gen IV (Sinnoh)','It habitually spins things on its nose. By doing so, it learns textures and odors.'),(9678,364,'heartgold','Gen IV (Johto)','It has a very sensitive nose. It touches new things with its nose to examine them.'),(9679,364,'soulsilver','Gen IV (Johto)','It has a very sensitive nose. It touches new things with its nose to examine them.'),(9680,364,'black','Gen V (Unova)','It habitually spins things on its nose. By doing so, it learns textures and odors.'),(9681,364,'white','Gen V (Unova)','It habitually spins things on its nose. By doing so, it learns textures and odors.'),(9682,364,'black-2','Gen V (Unova)','Be it Spheal or Poké Ball, it will spin any round object on its nose with the greatest of ease.'),(9683,364,'white-2','Gen V (Unova)','Be it Spheal or Poké Ball, it will spin any round object on its nose with the greatest of ease.'),(9684,364,'x','Gen VI (Kalos)','It has a very sensitive nose. It touches new things with its nose to examine them.'),(9685,364,'y','Gen VI (Kalos)','Be it Spheal or Poké Ball, it will spin any round object on its nose with the greatest of ease.'),(9686,364,'omega-ruby','Gen VI (Hoenn)','Sealeo has the habit of always juggling on the tip of its nose anything it sees for the first time. This Pokémon occasionally 