aces.'),(12519,568,'sun','Gen VII (Alola)','Unsanitary places are what they like best. They can be spotted in Alola, often with Grimer in hot pursuit.'),(12520,568,'moon','Gen VII (Alola)','It gorges on trash until its stomach is full. Then it belches toxic gas. An unlucky whiff of gas will put a person in the hospital.'),(12521,568,'ultra-sun','Gen VII (Alola)','Poisonous gas leaks out of it when it breathes. Muk that catch a whiff of that stench will come drooling.'),(12522,568,'ultra-moon','Gen VII (Alola)','If a young Pokémon or child breathes in the toxic gas that Trubbish belches out, it could be a life-threatening situation.'),(12523,568,'sword','Gen VIII (Galar)','Its favorite places are unsanitary ones. If you leave trash lying around, you could even find one of these Pokémon living in your room.'),(12524,568,'shield','Gen VIII (Galar)','This Pokémon was born from a bag stuffed with trash. Galarian Weezing relish the fumes belched by Trubbish.'),(12525,569,'black','Gen V (Unova)','It clenches opponents with its left arm and finishes them off with foul-smelling poison gas belched from its mouth.'),(12526,569,'white','Gen V (Unova)','They absorb garbage and make it part of their bodies. They shoot a poisonous liquid from their right-hand fingertips.'),(12527,569,'black-2','Gen V (Unova)','Consuming garbage makes new kinds of poison gases and liquids inside their bodies.'),(12528,569,'white-2','Gen V (Unova)','Consuming garbage makes new kinds of poison gases and liquids inside their bodies.'),(12529,569,'x','Gen VI (Kalos)','It clenches opponents with its left arm and finishes them off with foul-smelling poison gas belched from its mouth.'),(12530,569,'y','Gen VI (Kalos)','Consuming garbage makes new kinds of poison gases and liquids inside their bodies.'),(12531,569,'omega-ruby','Gen VI (Hoenn)','It clenches opponents with its left arm and finishes them off with foul-smelling poison gas belched from its mouth.'),(12532,569,'alpha-sapphire','Gen VI (Hoenn)','