ts way.'),(13839,713,'y','Gen VI (Kalos)','The way several Bergmite huddle on its back makes it look like an aircraft carrier made of ice.'),(13840,713,'omega-ruby','Gen VI (Hoenn)','Its ice-covered body is as hard as steel. Its cumbersome frame crushes anything that stands in its way.'),(13841,713,'alpha-sapphire','Gen VI (Hoenn)','The way several Bergmite huddle on its back makes it look like an aircraft carrier made of ice.'),(13842,713,'sword','Gen VIII (Galar)','At high latitudes, this Pokémon can be found with clusters of Bergmite on its back as it swims among the icebergs.'),(13843,713,'shield','Gen VIII (Galar)','As Avalugg moves about during the day, the cracks in its body deepen. The Pokémon’s body returns to a pristine state overnight.'),(13844,713,'legends-arceus','Gen VIII (Hisui)','The armor of ice covering its lower jaw puts steel to shame and can shatter rocks with ease. This Pokémon barrels along steep mountain paths, cleaving through the deep snow.'),(13845,716,'x','Gen VI (Kalos)','Legends say it can share eternal life. It slept for a thousand years in the form of a tree before its revival.'),(13846,716,'y','Gen VI (Kalos)','When the horns on its head shine in seven colors, it is said to be sharing everlasting life.'),(13847,716,'omega-ruby','Gen VI (Hoenn)','Legends say it can share eternal life. It slept for a thousand years in the form of a tree before its revival.'),(13848,716,'alpha-sapphire','Gen VI (Hoenn)','When the horns on its head shine in seven colors, it is said to be sharing everlasting life.'),(13849,715,'x','Gen VI (Kalos)','They fly around on moonless nights and attack careless prey. Nothing can beat them in a battle in the dark.'),(13850,715,'y','Gen VI (Kalos)','The ultrasonic waves it emits from its ears can reduce a large boulder to pebbles. It swoops out of the dark to attack.'),(13851,715,'omega-ruby','Gen VI (Hoenn)','They fly around on moonless nights and attack careless prey. Nothing can beat them in a battle in the dark.'),(13852,715,'alpha-sapphire','Gen VI (Hoenn)','The ultrasonic waves it emits from its ears can reduce a large boulder to pebbles. It swoops out of the dark to attack.'),(13853,715,'ultra-sun','Gen VII (Alola)','Although it has a violent disposition, if you give it a nice ripe fruit that it loves, Noivern will suddenly become tame.'),(13854,715,'ultra-moon','Gen VII (Alola)','This hot-blooded Pokémon attacks anything it sees with ultrasonic waves that can crush boulders.'),(13855,715,'sword','Gen VIII (Galar)','Aggressive and cruel, this Pokémon will ruthlessly torment enemies that are helpless in the dark.'),(13856,715,'shield','Gen VIII (Galar)','Flying through the darkness, it weakens enemies with ultrasonic waves that could crush stone. Its fangs finish the fight.'),(13857,719,'x','Gen VI (Kalos)','A sudden transformation of Carbink, its pink, glimmering body is said to be the loveliest sight in the whole world.'),(13858,719,'y','Gen VI (Kalos)','It can instantly create many diamonds by compressing the carbon in the air between its hands.'),(13859,719,'omega-ruby','Gen VI (Hoenn)','A sudden transformation of Carbink, its pink, glimmering body is said to be the loveliest sight in the whole world.'),(13860,719,'alpha-sapphire','Gen VI (Hoenn)','It can instantly create many diamonds by compressing the carbon in the air between its hands.'),(13861,718,'x','Gen VI (Kalos)','When the Kalos region’s ecosystem falls into disarray, it appears and reveals its secret power.'),(13862,718,'y','Gen VI (Kalos)','It’s hypothesized that it’s monitoring those who destroy the ecosystem from deep in the cave where it lives.'),(13863,718,'omega-ruby','Gen VI (Hoenn)','When the Kalos region’s ecosystem falls into disarray, it appears and reveals its secret power.'),(13864,718,'alpha-sapphire','Gen VI (Hoenn)','It’s hypothesized that it’s monitoring those who destroy the ecosystem from deep in the cave where it lives.'),(13865,718,'sun','Gen VII (Alola)','This is Zygarde’s form when 